  <item>
    <title>02.从大厂裸辞一年，让我看看旷野到底怎么个事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6698c47337236c546e051875</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6698c47337236c546e051875</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jul 2024 07:29:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家可以选择感兴趣部分直接点击时间节点跳转收听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 对于一年不上班，大家可能感兴趣的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 一年不上班爽不爽？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 没有收入怎么办？有没有什么搞钱的方法？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 关于搞钱，可能要先知道自己为什么而搞钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> 不上班会不会无聊？会焦虑吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a> 我对目前求职环境的观察分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> 后悔裸辞吗？会继续找工作或者回到职场吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="777">12:57</a> 会离开北京吗？考虑换城市生活吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 裸辞这一年的流水账分享 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">20:13</a> 对出去旅行有了一些不一样的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 关于裸辞和放松的一些碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023.07.28 离职那天的晚霞，真的是个适合离职的好天气啊</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqf6HK57CazP3S8GWZxcPlmRGwTO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>一不小心骑了300公里了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkVKBgxRsktGS6mtIEkVSMhRv5H6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>去年八月的运动记录</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGR6qNFwpPxIhSOL5tx1kDub4rT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2023.09 甘南的土拨鼠！真的好肥啊！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrxudmPb6TD2VGWWwr92rQHUYTk9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>禾木小镇的清晨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtiGhoLew-Ok_zZDC4EEOEk28X7v.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;阿勒泰真的太美啦！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnucwc5xkgpCn5Sk3jMPwQCDaGPt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;在鸣沙山解锁一个人坐热气球，上天啦！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqjFX-Yi2KEBvS3gWcCbReUPUhiq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2023.10 在乌镇戏剧节做一场关于戏剧的梦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhlgf24a6x95w7bxw_BRrPjbd-MX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2023.11 去火神庙道馆体验一日义工</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgdOAfBj7iRQEGWO701qYPxvvZiy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>最长的看剧体验，7个小时的俄罗斯话剧《静静的顿河》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjoy-DOEAHWuG68K6FTXopgPAfV3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>我的摄影记录，欢迎围观⬇️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoWkiqWxxczzhs0PCNHtizb9P_3K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2024. 1-2 在北海过年 直观感受北海的回南天</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjtQn_vWZWlL9a-f4pxBlV7dCRcL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2024.06 卑微站姐（本人）被顶流女明星（玲娜贝儿）硬控</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi3AYePVrX7FJJhMySccmWyJ7ttl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2024.6 阿那亚戏剧节，低估了海边的气温，穿少了被冻的快感冒，还在雨中的大树下看了一场剧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYkZQMqcSM0fMNHt1mOyvoyjX02.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2024.6 见到了一直非常喜欢的英剧的两位主创，开心！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTG3sjWM0O_uRm2Y-x3g8W_mT0u.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqG3k6qB_RKLzCQeKuHyQZJx2srN.m4a" length="40319172" type="audio/mp4"/>
