  <item>
    <title>01.大厂女工出逃记，裸辞是什么了不起的事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667ff7eb5c33fe90f5ac3684</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667ff7eb5c33fe90f5ac3684</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Jun 2024 12:02:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：seven &nbsp;前福报厂女工，现自由职业 a.k.a 街溜子</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：田甜 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;前宇宙厂女工，现武汉1923舞蹈教室主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 自我介绍，认识下我俩先</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 大厂工作体验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a> 为什么会在一个大家都说环境不好的时间放弃大厂相对稳定的工作，选择裸辞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 如何理解工作的意义感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 那些让我们最终决定裸辞的瞬间以及由此引发的自我探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> 提离职的过程比想象的要平和许多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 玄学给了我决定离职的临门一脚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> &nbsp;纠结离职的过程让我共情到了被家暴却走不出来的女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 来自周围的声音，为什么我不希望别人劝我忍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 裸辞之后的规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 一些美好的愿景</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltU-3sEUu-B53P-kxV6isVFcaPme.m4a" length="46124229" type="audio/mp4"/>
